  "notes": "Rules 1.19: a plain Pump adds +0.2 (the stage table climbs 0.2 a stage from x0.8). A feeling Pump has its own step instead: a Release's multiplier is the stage table's plus (step - 0.2) for each feeling Pump. Each feeling goes into an Outburst once. A feeling that buys the multiplier pays for it (1 Strain or 8 HP for +0.3 above the plain +0.2); a feeling that changes what the Release does steps +0.3; a strong one steps +0.2, 0 or -0.2: the multiplier going down is its price. No feeling does what a school, a module or an element already does, except where its text says why. Residue: the strongest feeling poured in (ties to the latest) on every tile the Release covered, for residue_rounds. Every number is provisional (spec 14, items 801, 1050 and 1100 on). Rules 1.20: Love heals a share of the Buff school's heal at the Release's multiplier (a quarter in the shape, 0.15 for the lone heal), not a share of the damage.",
